 "sentences": [
  {
   "slot": "H1",
   "text": "Every time he came home, this face was waiting above his door.",
   "kind": "HOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "face",
     "to": "skull_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H2",
   "text": "Everyone sees two old people sharing their soup.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "people",
     "to": "left_figure"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "One grins with an empty mouth.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 9,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "grins",
     "to": "left_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "One hand still holds a spoon.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "spoon",
     "to": "spoon"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "And the other has no eyes at all.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 11,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "eyes",
     "to": "skull_eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H4",
   "text": "Francisco Goya painted them in his seventies, on his own walls.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 2
  },
  {
   "slot": "H5",
   "text": "They were never meant to be seen by anyone else.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 4
  },
  {
   "slot": "H5",
   "text": "So why would a man eat under this?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "H6",
   "text": "The answer is where it hung.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "It likely sat above the main door of the house.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 5
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "That house was known as the House of the Deaf Man.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 3
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "And the second face has black hollows for eyes.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 11,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "hollows",
     "to": "skull_eyes"
    },
    {
     "on": "skull",
     "to": "skull_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H8",
   "text": "It isn't a neighbour.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "neighbour",
     "to": "skull_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H8",
   "text": "It's Death, sitting down to eat.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "Death",
     "to": "skull_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H9",
   "text": "So is that his neighbour, or the guest who comes for everyone?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "everyone",
